    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Melbourne-based independent game developer / creative technologist, active since ~2013 (itch.io since 2013). Prolific experimental indie games: Mars First Logistics (2025, Steam), Dissembler (Excellence in Design, Freeplay 2018, Steam), The Catacombs of Solaris (won Ludum Dare 33, 2016), Red Desert Render (2019), If We Were Allowed to Visit (2020, poetry/game collaboration with Gemma Mahadeo), Boson X (2013, Steam). Senior, ~12+ yrs self-directed game-making; publishes commercially via Shape Shop (his company). Instagram confirmed: @ianmaclarty (623 posts, bio matches). No LinkedIn found; solo indie dev with no professional profile presence. Email: ian at shapeshop.games (public). Work Status Freelance: solo independent developer self-publishing across itch.io/Steam. Autonomy 5: conceives, builds and ships games entirely solo. Capabilities are Jonathan-set; Creative technology fits the experimental game work.",
